{"id":"msg_m_ex_infinityrail_01","cat":"messenger","group":{"id":"room_infinityrail","label":"Infinity Rail · Group"},"label":"1. Everyone!","stage":null,"prev":null,"next":"msg_m_ex_infinityrail_02","speakers":{"diesel":"Diesel","soline":"Soline","brid":"Brid"},"icons":{"diesel":"si_c072_00_s","soline":"si_c071_00_s","brid":"si_c070_00_s"},"lines":[{"id":"m_ex_infinityrail_01_1","type":"Speech","speaker":"diesel","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_infinityrail_01_1","text":"Everyone!","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_infinityrail_01_2","type":"Speech","speaker":"diesel","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_infinityrail_01_2","text":"I have some bad news...","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_infinityrail_01_3","type":"Speech","speaker":"diesel","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_infinityrail_01_3","text":"All of my strawberry candy fell on the floor T_T","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_infinityrail_01_4","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_infinityrail_01_4","text":"Great.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_infinityrail_01_5","type":"Speech","speaker":"soline","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_infinityrail_01_5","text":"Great!!!","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_infinityrail_01_6","type":"Speech","speaker":"diesel","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_infinityrail_01_6","text":"Great?!","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_infinityrail_01_7","type":"Speech","speaker":"diesel","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_infinityrail_01_7","text":"Why! Do you guys hate strawberry candy that much?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_infinityrail_01_8","type":"Speech","speaker":"soline","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_infinityrail_01_8","text":"Not really.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_infinityrail_01_9","type":"Speech","speaker":"soline","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_infinityrail_01_9","text":"It's just that sometimes we wanna try some other flavors, hee-hee.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_infinityrail_01_10","type":"Speech","speaker":"diesel","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_infinityrail_01_10","text":"You're such a meanie, Soline!","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_infinityrail_01_11","type":"Speech","speaker":"diesel","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_infinityrail_01_11","text":"I could tell from your expression that you really enjoyed the strawberry candy.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_infinityrail_01_12","type":"Speech","speaker":"diesel","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_infinityrail_01_12","text":"But soon as you finish them, then you complain about wanting other flavors.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_infinityrail_01_13","type":"Speech","speaker":"soline","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_infinityrail_01_13","text":"That's not true!","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_infinityrail_01_14","type":"Speech","speaker":"diesel","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_infinityrail_01_14","text":"And Commander's so mean as well!","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_infinityrail_01_15","type":"Speech","speaker":"diesel","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_infinityrail_01_15","text":"You told me you enjoyed strawberry candy,","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_infinityrail_01_16","type":"Speech","speaker":"diesel","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_infinityrail_01_16","text":"but now, you just put them away.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_infinityrail_01_17","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_infinityrail_01_17","text":"It's not like that.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_infinityrail_01_18","type":"Speech","speaker":"diesel","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_infinityrail_01_18","text":"Why hasn't Brid said anything?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_infinityrail_01_19","type":"Speech","speaker":"soline","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_infinityrail_01_19","text":"Indeed. Why's she so quiet today?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_infinityrail_01_20","type":"Speech","speaker":"soline","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_infinityrail_01_20","text":"Brid, I summon you!","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_infinityrail_01_21","type":"Speech","speaker":"diesel","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_infinityrail_01_21","text":"Reveal yourself!","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_infinityrail_01_22","type":"Choice","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_infinityrail_01_22","text":"I—summon—you—","jump":"m_ex_infinityrail_01_24"},{"id":"m_ex_infinityrail_01_23","type":"Choice","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_infinityrail_01_23","text":"I summon you","jump":"m_ex_infinityrail_01_24"},{"id":"m_ex_infinityrail_01_24","type":"Speech","speaker":"brid","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_infinityrail_01_24","text":"I'm working.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_infinityrail_01_25","type":"Speech","speaker":"soline","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_infinityrail_01_25","text":"Summoning success! Hahaha.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_infinityrail_01_26","type":"Speech","speaker":"diesel","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_infinityrail_01_26","text":"Brid, what's your opinion?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_infinityrail_01_27","type":"Speech","speaker":"diesel","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_infinityrail_01_27","text":"All of our strawberry candy fell on the floor.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_infinityrail_01_28","type":"Speech","speaker":"diesel","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_infinityrail_01_28","text":"Isn't it such a waste?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_infinityrail_01_29","type":"Speech","speaker":"brid","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_infinityrail_01_29","text":"Diesel","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_infinityrail_01_30","type":"Speech","speaker":"diesel","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_infinityrail_01_30","text":"Huh?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_infinityrail_01_31","type":"Speech","speaker":"brid","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_infinityrail_01_31","text":"I don't have a sweet tooth.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_infinityrail_01_32","type":"Speech","speaker":"brid","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_infinityrail_01_32","text":"So I've got nothing to say about this.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_infinityrail_01_33","type":"Speech","speaker":"diesel","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_infinityrail_01_33","text":"Oh I see. I've never seen Brid eating candy.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_infinityrail_01_34","type":"Speech","speaker":"diesel","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_infinityrail_01_34","text":"Then Brid gets a pass!","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_infinityrail_01_35","type":"Speech","speaker":"soline","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_infinityrail_01_35","text":"You traitor!!!!","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_infinityrail_01_36","type":"Speech","speaker":"brid","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_infinityrail_01_36","text":"You two,","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_infinityrail_01_37","type":"Speech","speaker":"brid","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_infinityrail_01_37","text":"have been mucking around all day.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_infinityrail_01_38","type":"Speech","speaker":"brid","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_infinityrail_01_38","text":"Have you even finished your work for today?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_infinityrail_01_39","type":"Speech","speaker":"soline","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_infinityrail_01_39","text":"Ah.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_infinityrail_01_40","type":"Speech","speaker":"brid","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_infinityrail_01_40","text":"I reckon, you must have.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_infinityrail_01_41","type":"Speech","speaker":"brid","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_infinityrail_01_41","text":"In ten minutes,","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_infinityrail_01_42","type":"Speech","speaker":"brid","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_infinityrail_01_42","text":"I'll go check your work logs.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_infinityrail_01_43","type":"Speech","speaker":"diesel","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_infinityrail_01_43","text":"Ugh, Commander. Something else came up. I gotta go!","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_infinityrail_01_44","type":"Speech","speaker":"soline","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_infinityrail_01_44","text":"Me too! Excuse me!","jump":null}],"chat":true}